{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sal\u00e1ta</strong> - A Card Game of Strategy, Luck, and Rivalry!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Sal\u00e1ta</i>, the ultimate card game where friends become frenemies and every move counts! Whether you're a seasoned card shark or a complete beginner, <i>Sal\u00e1ta</i> offers endless fun, chaos, and clever strategy for everyone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Familiarity with French Cards is a Plus, But We'll Teach You!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not familiar with French playing cards? No worries! You'll pick up the basics in no time. <br>The core of <strong><i>Sal\u00e1ta</i></strong> is all about messing with your opponents. Hand out negative points and watch alliances crumble as you fight for the top score. <br>Combine tactical thinking with a bit of luck to outsmart your opponents. Every decision you make can shift the balance of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 8 different game modes on your turn, but beware\u2014once you pick one, you can\u2019t select it again until your options reset! Your choices not only affect your current strategy but also your future moves. <br>Battle it out with up to 4 players\u2014or use bots if you're flying solo. We're working on expanding the game to support 5 or 6 players soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/f67a5d0f037177cde1ec4a4d8698894d.poster.avif?t=1769462231\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/f67a5d0f037177cde1ec4a4d8698894d.webm?t=1769462231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/f67a5d0f037177cde1ec4a4d8698894d.mp4?t=1769462231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against bots who can\u2019t see your cards, giving you a challenging but fair solo experience. <br>Join quick-play lobbies to instantly jump into the action or host custom games with friends across platforms, including Android phones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/e8436dc255dad4ad38df9cc55a92fe2d.poster.avif?t=1769462231\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/e8436dc255dad4ad38df9cc55a92fe2d.webm?t=1769462231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/e8436dc255dad4ad38df9cc55a92fe2d.mp4?t=1769462231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Host a game on your tablet and let up to 4 players join the fun locally for an awesome party experience. <br>Enjoy the game in your native language, and if it\u2019s not available, reach out\u2014we\u2019re always adding more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Test your skills with exciting in-game challenges that push your strategy to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/1c174b10587ee1ac6e57dde8c3c5d0e3.poster.avif?t=1769462231\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/1c174b10587ee1ac6e57dde8c3c5d0e3.webm?t=1769462231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/1c174b10587ee1ac6e57dde8c3c5d0e3.mp4?t=1769462231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your success with cumulative scores that rate your overall performance across games. <br>Unlock unique card backs to personalize your deck as you master the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/cf73ba8fa73b3d5bf5a2bfe6be2c3185.poster.avif?t=1769462231\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/cf73ba8fa73b3d5bf5a2bfe6be2c3185.webm?t=1769462231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/cf73ba8fa73b3d5bf5a2bfe6be2c3185.mp4?t=1769462231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your incredible hands, epic scores, or just chat strategy on our Discord server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also features that can help with people with color blindness or if you have a hard time differentiating between cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/28976c6c20735ae251aacfe5c683ec7e.poster.avif?t=1769462231\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/28976c6c20735ae251aacfe5c683ec7e.webm?t=1769462231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/extras/28976c6c20735ae251aacfe5c683ec7e.mp4?t=1769462231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Sal\u00e1ta</i>, where every turn is a mix of risk, reward, and revenge. Whether you're playing solo or with friends, the fun (and the drama) never stops!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner's route","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478300/da04e571761a84df5a5e0f9df6bd0465ce7615bd.jpg"},{"name":"Sweat and Tear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478300/e639acef944fb5892dbebeb2d0f57bb526894ac5.jpg"},{"name":"No trickster!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478300/26f65e5bf684cd616856a3d9cfcf2b725def1d28.jpg"},{"name":"Forbidden Color","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478300/aaa2307e75a79655dbde4e0dfec57b9394ba23fd.jpg"},{"name":"Boiz be boiz","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478300/d1e1c32afded9a4fde92d14159e869e55a2de67b.jpg"},{"name":"Bow and behold!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478300/82dee72c7efb5558e1256301d9a29ea65f543f97.jpg"},{"name":"The Undesired Pair","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478300/57ee3b3142a88c76a5d20008b49e6abb583235c2.jpg"},{"name":"Mighty Heart Ruler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478300/4ea8054f5e18adb920c15f62a97b3464390f0255.jpg"},{"name":"Accomplished Gift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478300/d21003b2fc98d5c882c49456cb62fb5287c331c4.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Log","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3478300/be6903768730ca193cf216add5ddc04d47c10500.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3478300?t=1769462231","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/4eb9eb733b945d98f931719eb3a7b4d8d6014b21/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769462231","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478300/fd